{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/0cf104ea7b4a0639a5f98cb0417461a6.avif?t=1759139583\" width=615 height=415 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the bustling city of Salamanca in the 1910s, a place where tradition and innovation meet! In Toymaker: Threads of Joy, you'll experience the art of toy crafting and the thrill of managing your very own shop. More than just any ordinary business venture, Toymaker is a journey filled with magic, folklore, and enchanting locales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each toy you craft and decision you make carries weight - will you uphold traditions of the past, or forge a new path? Dive into this enchanting blend of simulation, storytelling and management, where every moment is a chance to create something truly magical!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/b82e6cca91c4a284a4273579423baef1.avif?t=1759139583\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Crafting with Care</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/1c8918ff5f20b8f8f1b3a15cfe66a54f.poster.avif?t=1759139583\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/1c8918ff5f20b8f8f1b3a15cfe66a54f.webm?t=1759139583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/1c8918ff5f20b8f8f1b3a15cfe66a54f.mp4?t=1759139583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to define what the next cherished plushie will be! Experience a chill and cozy crafting workshop. Unlock and collect materials, colors and patterns, sew the toy together and add beautiful details to craft the perfect toy for their next adopter - with no time constraint, just creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Storefront Success</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/fdd5111711b355b70fda9e5aa634914d.poster.avif?t=1759139583\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/fdd5111711b355b70fda9e5aa634914d.webm?t=1759139583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the word gets out about your shop, customers will commission new toys and haggle for a better price. Make sure you understand their needs though! Your reputation will grow or decrease depending on your clientele\u2019s treatment - a happy patron will recommend you to their friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Magical Narrative</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/e13eda0355495702648893fc90f55297.poster.avif?t=1759139583\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/e13eda0355495702648893fc90f55297.webm?t=1759139583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your customers, and they\u2019ll reward you with hidden stories and mysteries. Visit emblematic locations in Salamanca - its markets, squares, university and even the countryside! - in a captivating journey inspired by a folk legend and mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Pathway Possibilities</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/57425ed8cd2f945c33af80bf83301e9a.poster.avif?t=1759139583\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/57425ed8cd2f945c33af80bf83301e9a.webm?t=1759139583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the destiny of Salamanca by following two distinct mythic paths with their own perks and storyline. Your choice will influence the future of the town and the legacy of your toy shop, so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/2e43205a8d135f5a04dd2d1e8fed253e.avif?t=1759139583\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing casual gameplay with rewarding interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gorgeous art nouveau style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Super cute plushies (*^_^*)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lovely piano music inspired in the 1910s and folk music from Castille</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/c6e621ed6adbb5f0466c4c717e960f50.avif?t=1759139583\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968270?t=1759139583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759139583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/f890bd053a9683894074d874e8e42e90f4f5af3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759139583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/f890bd053a9683894074d874e8e42e90f4f5af3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759139583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/0cf104ea7b4a0639a5f98cb0417461a6.avif?t=1759139583\" width=615 height=415 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the bustling city of Salamanca in the 1910s, a place where tradition and innovation meet! In Toymaker: Threads of Joy, you'll experience the art of toy crafting and the thrill of managing your very own shop. More than just any ordinary business venture, Toymaker is a journey filled with magic, folklore, and enchanting locales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each toy you craft and decision you make carries weight - will you uphold traditions of the past, or forge a new path? Dive into this enchanting blend of simulation, storytelling and management, where every moment is a chance to create something truly magical!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=